pFrameMonitor (pymoos2 example)

Publishes the local frame's distortion at the vehicle (FRAME_DISTORTION) and
raises an appcast run warning past the thresholds in data/thresholds.json.

  pFrameMonitor/
    CMakeLists.txt
    pframemonitor/          installed
      __init__.py  __main__.py  app.py
      frames/  metrics/  data/thresholds.json
    tests/                  not installed

  pFrameMonitor targ.moos        run
  pFrameMonitor -e               example config
  python -m pytest tests         unit tests
